1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,850
15:00 — Tomás took the corner seat at Mudhaus.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:10,850
Some things you could set your watch to.

3
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:14,850
DAY 10 · 15:00 — the corner seat stayed empty.

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:20,850
Nobody explains it. There is no narrator.

5
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:28,850
You leave for a week. The block keeps score.

6
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:34,850
Same street. A different neighborhood.

7
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:41,850
A choice on day 10 changed day 12. Nobody scripted it.

8
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:46,850
Make the call. Come back and check.

9
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:51,850
REAL WORLD — T H E  M I S S I O N — Come back tomorrow. It'll be different.
